  description: "Chi\u1EBFu b\xE0i gi\u1EA3ng, camera b\xE0n gi\xE1o vi\xEAn, c\xE2u h\u1ECFi th\u1EA3o lu\u1EADn. B\u1EA5m v\xE0o m\xE0n h\xECnh \u0111\u1EC3 sang trang."
